data: {"id": "ce9548cf1a1241de-thinking-parallel_evidence-1711", "run_id": "ce9548cf1a1241de", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据分析\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期确认\n\n**Metrics 事实：**\n- `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 for phase=**Pending** (Pod 处于 Pending 阶段)\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 for reason=**ContainerCreating** (容器等待原因)\n- `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 (零重启)\n- Pod UID: `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`，节点: node2\n\n### 2. Pod 描述事件 — 核心证据\n\n`kubectl describe` 返回两个关键 Warning 事件：\n\n1. **`FailedMount` (55s, x15 over 15m)**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789045926190, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

