data: {"id": "ce9548cf1a1241de-final", "run_id": "ce9548cf1a1241de", "seq": 1716, "ts_ms": 1789045937610, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 的 Volume `input` 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，导致 kubelet MountVolume 失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `Warning FailedMount 55s (x15 over 15m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 核心证据：直接指出 Volume 挂载失败的具体原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `Warning FailedMount 111s (x6 over 13m) kubelet Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 核心证据：确认故障具有持续性，自 111s 起持续发生 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `container.waiting_reason: {\"container\": \"app\", \"reason\": \"ContainerCreating\"}` | 支撑证据：确认容器因挂载失败而处于等待状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `pod.status: {\"status\": \"Pending\"}` | 支撑证据：确认 Pod 整体卡在调度后的挂载阶段，未进入运行状态 |\n\n> **证据关联说明：**\n> 证据 1 与证据 2 在时间维度（15m/13m 窗口）与状态维度（FailedMount）上互为印证，排除偶发性故障；证据 1 与证据 3 形成因果闭环：配置缺失导致挂载失败（证据1），进而导致容器进入 ContainerCreating 等待状态（证据3）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap `unavailable-config` 缺失 → Kubelet MountVolume 失败 (证据1/2) → 容器持续等待启动 (证据3) → Pod 状态为 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 定义中引用的 Volume `input` 绑定了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。该配置缺失导致 kubelet 无法完成挂载，直接引发 `FailedMount` 事件，使得容器无法进入运行状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 543.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 32.9s (Evidence 28.6s, RCA 4.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 583.727, "metrics": {"run_id": "ce9548cf1a1241de", "mttr": {"value": "9.7m", "seconds": 583.7345614433289, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 583734.5614433289, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 580556.9925308228, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6828.732013702393, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2869.3087100982666}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 543717.5257205963, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 32852.33449935913, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.